"],"ch":13},{"t":17.65,"dur":5,"clip":"12_consumer-vr/Person_stumbling_on_VR_cable_202607101942.mp4","file":"assets/12_consumer-vr/Person_stumbling_on_VR_cable_202607101942.mp4","in":0,"text":"But this was an illusion. We believed that we could escape into a new world.","kw":["illusion","believed","could","escape","world"],"ch":12},{"t":25.63,"dur":3.92,"clip":"11_oculus/Programmer_illuminated_by_termin…_202607101941.mp4","file":"assets/11_oculus/Programmer_illuminated_by_termin…_202607101941.mp4","in":5.04,"text":"They believed that they could capture the entire world in lines of code.","kw":["believed","could","capture","entire","world","lines","code"],"ch":11},{"t":32.4,"dur":5.6,"clip":"10_vr-winter/Presenter_unveils_VR_headset_202607101901.mp4","file":"assets/10_vr-winter/Presenter_unveils_VR_headset_202607101901.mp4","in":0,"text":"Imagine stepping completely inside your favorite video games. This is not science fiction. This is reality.","kw":["imagine","stepping","completely","inside","your","favorite","video","games"],"ch":10},{"t":40.03,"dur":3.14,"clip":"09_arcade-era/Reporter_describes_virtual_reali…_202607101900.mp4","file":"assets/09_arcade-era/Reporter_describes_virtual_reali…_202607101900.mp4","in":6.52,"text":"Just step inside one of these futuristic pods.","kw":["just","step","inside","these","futuristic","pods"],"ch":9},{"t":47.22,"dur":6,"clip":"08_vpl/Programmers_working_at_workstations_202607101938.mp4","file":"assets/08_vpl/Programmers_working_at_workstations_202607101938.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1987, a small group of programmers thought they could escape the confines of reality.","kw":["small","group","programmers","thought","could","escape","confines","reality"],"ch":8},{"t":54.64,"dur":6,"clip":"07_nasa-view/Researcher_wearing_head-mounted_…_202607101936.mp4","file":"assets/07_nasa-view/Researcher_wearing_head-mounted_…_202607101936.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1985, we believed we could escape into the machine.","kw":["believed","could","escape","machine"],"ch":7},{"t":62.05,"dur":5,"clip":"06_public-grid/Community_members_operate_video_…_202607101928.mp4","file":"assets/06_public-grid/Community_members_operate_video_…_202607101928.mp4","in":3.88,"text":"They believed they could use tape to create a new kind of society.","kw":["believed","could","tape","create","kind","society"],"ch":6},{"t":69.46,"dur":6,"clip":"05_damocles/Test_subject_beneath_mechanical_arm_202607101926.mp4","file":"assets/05_damocles/Test_subject_beneath_mechanical_arm_202607101926.mp4","in":3.88,"text":"They wanted to map the human mind, to connect the brain directly to a digital world.","kw":["wanted","human","mind","connect","brain","directly","digital","world"],"ch":5},{"t":76.88,"dur":6,"clip":"04_ultimate-display/Television_weather_map_graphics_202607101924.mp4","file":"assets/04_ultimate-display/Television_weather_map_graphics_202607101924.mp4","in":0,"text":"This was the moment when we began to believe that the entire world could be managed by data.","kw":["moment","when","began","believe","entire","world","could","managed"],"ch":4},{"t":84.29,"dur":6.6,"clip":"03_sensorama/AI_historical_reconstruction_Sen…_202607101851.mp4","file":"assets/03_sensorama/AI_historical_reconstruction_Sen…_202607101851.mp4","in":0,"text":"The Censorama offers a fully integrated experience, with simulated wind and aroma to enhance the illusion.","kw":["censorama","offers","fully","integrated","experience","simulated","wind","aroma"],"ch":3},{"t":91.71,"dur":6,"clip":"02_telesphere/Presenter_demonstrating_portable…_202607101849.mp4","file":"assets/02_telesphere/Presenter_demonstrating_portable…_202607101849.mp4","in":3.88,"text":"This is your own private theater, a truly personal cinema experience.","kw":["your","private","theater","truly","personal","cinema","experience"],"ch":2},{"t":99.85,"dur":5,"clip":"01_3d-golden/Factory_workers_putting_on_goggles_202607101843.mp4","file":"assets/01_3d-golden/Factory_workers_putting_on_goggles_202607101843.mp4"